* ident_call1 -- counts to N, testing IDENT(A) once per step (the 1-arg predicate).
* bottleneck: one 1-arg IDENT() call per iteration (s199 slice 2/3 inline measurement).
* Standalone:  scrip ident_call1.sno   |   sbl -bf ident_call1.sno   |   snobol4 ident_call1.sno
        &TRIM = 1
        &ANCHOR = 0
        &STLIMIT = -1
        DEFINE('IDENT_CALL1(N)')                        :(IDENT_CALL1_END)
IDENT_CALL1  A = 0
        ZI = 1
ZBL     A = A + 1
        IDENT(A)
        ZI = LT(ZI, N) ZI + 1                           :S(ZBL)
        IDENT_CALL1 = A                                 :(RETURN)
IDENT_CALL1_END
*BENCH kernel=IDENT_CALL1 check=1000 bud=500 flr=20
        OUTPUT = 'ident_call1(1000) = ' IDENT_CALL1(1000)
END
